@startuml
title Monitor prices and trigger alerts (SQ-02)
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow false
participant "Shopper" as P0 #edf1f5
participant "Shopper Client" as P1 #eaf2ff
participant "Shopping API" as P2 #fff3df
participant "Watch Monitor" as P3 #fff3df
participant "Data Store" as P4 #f3edff
participant "Catalog Query" as P5 #fff3df
participant "Time Trigger" as P6 #edf1f5
P0 -> P1 : Select laptop and target price
activate P1
P1 -> P2 : saveWatch(deviceId, productId, targetPrice)
activate P2
P2 -> P3 : saveWatch(deviceId, productId, targetPrice)
activate P3
P3 -> P3 : Validate device id, laptop, positive target, max 20 watches per device
P3 -> P4 : Upsert watch (new target starts a new alert episode)
P4 --> P3 : Watch saved
P3 --> P2 : Confirmation
deactivate P3
P2 --> P1 : Active watch
deactivate P2
P1 --> P0 : Show active watch
deactivate P1
P6 -> P3 : checkWatches() every 30 minutes
activate P3
P3 -> P4 : Read enabled watches
P4 --> P3 : Watches with alert state
loop each enabled watch
P3 -> P5 : getCurrentOffers(productId)
P5 --> P3 : Latest offer per retailer with observedAt
P3 -> P3 : Take lowest comparable offer; check age against 48 h limit
alt fresh offer at or below target and no alert in this episode
P3 -> P4 : Set alerted and store alert with deduplication key (one transaction)
P4 --> P3 : Alert stored / already exists
else fresh offer above target after an earlier alert
P3 -> P4 : End the episode
else stale, missing or target not reached
P3 -> P3 : Skip; nothing created or reset
end
end
P3 --> P6 : Check outcome (checked, alerted, skipped)
deactivate P3
P0 -> P1 : Open application / alerts
activate P1
P1 -> P2 : getAlerts(deviceId)
activate P2
P2 -> P3 : listAlerts(deviceId)
activate P3
P3 -> P4 : Load alerts of this device
P4 --> P3 : Alerts
P3 --> P2 : Alert list
deactivate P3
P2 --> P1 : Alert list
deactivate P2
P1 --> P0 : Display in-app notifications
deactivate P1
@enduml
